msgctxt "84_Megu the Rising Star"
msgid "Hey, Aya-san, have you heard of Amoebatar?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "96_Megu the Rising Star"
msgid "One of my regular customers told me about it. Apparently you can make an avatar that looks just like you, then use it to chat with people! It's really cute!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "108_Former Top Hostess Aya"
msgid "Oh, I know all about it. Pretty much everyone in the business is super into it."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "120_Former Top Hostess Aya"
msgid "It'd be kinda cool to hang out with a movie star, even if it's just in the Amoebaverse."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "132_Megu the Rising Star"
msgid "Totally! Ohmigosh, what if I logged in and Yuichi-kun was there, and we started talking, and, and... Oh, gosh, I'm literally gonna die right now."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "144_Megu the Rising Star"
msgid "Screw work. I've gotta get home, make myself a super cute avatar, and doll her up all perfect! You should come do it with me, Aya-san!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "156_Former Top Hostess Aya"
msgid "Sure. I mean, I've had one for months."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "168_Megu the Rising Star"
msgid "I should've guessed! You're always on top of all the latest trends."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "180_Former Top Hostess Aya"
msgid "I heard about it from an old customer of mine. Sounds like he's been requesting you nowadays, though. Good for you."
msgstr ""

